1334:   /**
1335:    * Caches the promise value and provides it to all future subscribers, if it satisfies the predicate.
1336:    * <p>
1337:    * This method is equivalent to using {@link #cacheResultIf(Predicate)} with a predicate that requires
1338:    * a successful result and for the value to satisfy the predicate given to this method.
1339:    * <p>
1340:    * Non success results will not be cached.
1341:    *
1342:    * @param shouldCache the test for whether a successful result is cacheable
1343:    * @return a caching promise
1344:    * @since 1.4
1345:    */
