1038:   /**
1039:    * Applies the given function to {@code this} and returns the result.
1040:    * <p>
1041:    * This method can be useful when needing to convert a promise to another type as it facilitates doing so without breaking the “code flow”.
1042:    * For example, this can be used when integrating with RxJava.
1043:    * <pre class="java">{@code
1044:    * import ratpack.rx.RxRatpack;
